# Bug verification — v4 Fidelity Sweep (regression pins)
# Ported from tests/zork1.regtest, which the runner no longer reads
# once a .scenario file exists.
# ============================================================

== verify-176-matchbook-to-clearing: Matchbook fetched, back at the Clearing  [fidelity sweep]
# Shared route for the burn pins: Dam Lobby matchbook, then back overground
# to the Clearing. (ZIL BURN always needs a flame, so #165 needs one too.)
@ round-room
> n
> ne
> nw
> e
> n
? /Dam Lobby
> take matchbook
? Taken
> s
? /Dam
> s
? /Deep Canyon
> sw
? /North-South Passage
> s
? /Round Room
> w
> w
? /Troll Room
# The trap door is barred behind you after the first descent, so return
# through the maze and the Cyclops Room (odysseus opens the way to the Living Room).
> w
> s
> e
> u
> sw
> e
> s
> se
?? /Cyclops Room
> odysseus
? /flees
> e
> e
? /Living Room
> e
? /Kitchen
> e
? /Behind House
> n
> n
? /Forest Path
> n
?? /Clearing
?? /pile of leaves

== verify-165-leaves-ground: Burning leaves on the ground is not fatal  [fidelity sweep]
# #165: Burning leaves on the ground should NOT kill the player
@ verify-176-matchbook-to-clearing
> light match
? /starts to burn
> burn leaves with match
? /With the leaves moved, a grating is revealed
? /The leaves burn
?! and so do you

== verify-169-tree-single-item: Single ground item visible from tree  [fidelity sweep]
# #169: A single dropped item should be visible from Up a Tree
@ startup
> open mailbox
> take leaflet
? Taken
> n
> n
? /Forest Path
> drop leaflet
> up
? /Up a Tree
> look
? /On the ground below you can see
? /leaflet

== verify-171-chimney-scoring: Chimney climb does not double-score  [fidelity sweep]
# #171: Chimney climb to Kitchen uses move-the-player; should not double-score
@ cellar
> s
> e
? /Gallery
> n
? /Studio
# Drop sword so we carry only lantern (1 item, <= 2)
> drop sword
> up
? /Kitchen
# Kitchen was already visited via window entry, so no score message
?! score has just gone up

== verify-167-invisible-trap-door: Hidden trap door is out of parser scope  [fidelity sweep]
# #167: zil-invisible things should not be accessible to the parser
@ living-room
# Trap door is zil-invisible until rug is pushed
> open trap door
? /can't see any such thing
> take trap door
? /can't see any such thing
# Now reveal it
> push rug
? /trap door
> open trap door
?? /rickety staircase

== verify-170-painting-no-points: Destroyed painting awards no points  [fidelity sweep]
# #170: Destroying painting then taking it should award no points
@ cellar
> s
> e
? /Gallery
> attack painting
? /destroyed one
> take painting
?! score has just gone up

