== verify-173-nest-fdesc: Nest FDESC only prints untouched in the tree  [fidelity sweep]
# #173: "Beside you on the branch..." must only print while the nest is
# untouched at Up a Tree; once taken it falls back to standard listing.
@ startup
> n
> n
? /Forest Path
> up
?? /Up a Tree
? /Beside you on the branch
> take nest
? Taken
> look
?! Beside you on the branch
> d
? /Forest Path
> drop nest
> look
? /bird's nest
?! Beside you on the branch

== verify-174-bubble-no-stream: Green bubble has no invented stream text  [fidelity sweep]
# #174: "examine bubble" must not claim the bubble floats in a stream;
# ZIL has no examine text, so I7's default "nothing special" applies.
@ dam
> examine bubble
? /nothing special
?! floating in the stream

== verify-176-burn-carried: Burning leaves you are holding is fatal  [fidelity sweep]
# #165/#176: the carry-check must survive the burn-with refactor
@ verify-176-matchbook-to-clearing
> take leaves
? /grating is revealed
> light match
> burn leaves with match
? /The leaves burn, and so do you

== verify-176-burn-inference: Bare burn supplies the one flame in reach  [fidelity sweep]
# #176 / ZIL GWIM: with exactly one FLAMEBIT object available the parser supplies it
@ verify-176-matchbook-to-clearing
> light match
> burn leaves
? /\(with the matchbook\)
? /The leaves burn
?! and so do you

== verify-176-burn-prompt: Bare burn with no flame asks, then vets the answer  [fidelity sweep]
# #176: the parser prompt, then PRE-BURN's "With a X??!?" for a non-flaming instrument
@ startup
> open mailbox
> take leaflet
> n
> n
> n
?? /Clearing
> burn leaves
? /What do you want to burn the pile of leaves with
> hands
? /With a pair of hands\?\?!\?
?! The leaves burn
> burn leaves with leaflet
? /With a leaflet\?\?!\?
?! grating
> look
? /pile of leaves

